# RakazAIBase .env.example — NAMES ONLY. Copy to .env.local. Never commit real values.
# Rule: NEVER delete or rename keys. Missing keys → feature idles (503 / not configured).
# Source of truth for filled values: /workspace/rakaza-prep/.env (chmod 600). Sync names from there.
# Solana-era names are kept intentionally for reference parity; Base Mini App uses Base/Farcaster block.


